      <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; color: #0369a1; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
        3. Content (Rich Text — Copy &amp; Paste Directly into Blog Editor)
      </h2>
      <div class="blog-rich-content" style="border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; padding: 18px; background-color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6; color: #0f172a;">
        <h2><strong>MLOPS&nbsp;Course:&nbsp;Build,&nbsp;Deploy&nbsp;and&nbsp;Scale&nbsp;Production&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Systems&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>An&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course&nbsp;teaches&nbsp;the&nbsp;skills&nbsp;to&nbsp;deploy,&nbsp;scale,&nbsp;and&nbsp;monitor&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning&nbsp;models&nbsp;in&nbsp;production&nbsp;using&nbsp;Docker,&nbsp;Kubernetes,&nbsp;MLflow,&nbsp;and&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;pipelines.&nbsp;The&nbsp;global&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;from&nbsp;USD&nbsp;3.33&nbsp;billion&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026&nbsp;to&nbsp;USD&nbsp;56.60&nbsp;billion&nbsp;by&nbsp;2035,&nbsp;a&nbsp;37%&nbsp;CAGR.&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;Engineers&nbsp;earn&nbsp;an&nbsp;average&nbsp;of&nbsp;₹16.5&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;and&nbsp;$161,411&nbsp;per&nbsp;year&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US.&nbsp;Graduates&nbsp;qualify&nbsp;for&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;Engineer,&nbsp;ML&nbsp;Platform&nbsp;Engineer,&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Infrastructure&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;roles.</p><h2><strong>Key&nbsp;Takeaways</strong></h2><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The&nbsp;global&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;37%&nbsp;CAGR,&nbsp;from&nbsp;$3.33B&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026&nbsp;to&nbsp;$56.60B&nbsp;by&nbsp;2035.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Core&nbsp;tools&nbsp;taught&nbsp;include&nbsp;Docker,&nbsp;Kubernetes,&nbsp;MLflow,&nbsp;Kubeflow,&nbsp;Apache&nbsp;Airflow,&nbsp;and&nbsp;one&nbsp;major&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;platform.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Indian&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;range&nbsp;from&nbsp;₹6&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;at&nbsp;entry&nbsp;level&nbsp;to&nbsp;₹35+&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;at&nbsp;senior&nbsp;level;&nbsp;US&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;range&nbsp;from&nbsp;$87,000&nbsp;to&nbsp;$240,000+.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;55%&nbsp;of&nbsp;companies&nbsp;cite&nbsp;inadequate&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;practices&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;major&nbsp;obstacle&nbsp;to&nbsp;production&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Software&nbsp;and&nbsp;ML&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;roles&nbsp;are&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;15%&nbsp;through&nbsp;2034,&nbsp;far&nbsp;above&nbsp;the&nbsp;3%&nbsp;average&nbsp;for&nbsp;all&nbsp;occupations.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BFSI&nbsp;holds&nbsp;roughly&nbsp;28%&nbsp;of&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;market&nbsp;share,&nbsp;the&nbsp;largest&nbsp;of&nbsp;any&nbsp;industry&nbsp;vertical.</p><h2><strong>What&nbsp;Is&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOPS&nbsp;Course?</strong></h2><p>An&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course&nbsp;is&nbsp;a&nbsp;structured&nbsp;training&nbsp;program&nbsp;covering&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Operations:&nbsp;applying&nbsp;DevOps&nbsp;principles&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;automation,&nbsp;testing,&nbsp;monitoring,&nbsp;and&nbsp;version&nbsp;control&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;machine&nbsp;learning&nbsp;lifecycle.&nbsp;It&nbsp;covers&nbsp;packaging,&nbsp;deploying,&nbsp;scaling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;models&nbsp;reliably&nbsp;in&nbsp;production&nbsp;rather&nbsp;than&nbsp;only&nbsp;building&nbsp;them.&nbsp;A&nbsp;2025&nbsp;systematic&nbsp;review&nbsp;found&nbsp;that&nbsp;55%&nbsp;of&nbsp;companies&nbsp;cite&nbsp;inadequate&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;practices&nbsp;as&nbsp;a&nbsp;major&nbsp;obstacle&nbsp;to&nbsp;deployment,&nbsp;while&nbsp;70%&nbsp;of&nbsp;organizations&nbsp;are&nbsp;actively&nbsp;investing&nbsp;in&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;tools.&nbsp;Most&nbsp;courses&nbsp;combine&nbsp;software&nbsp;engineering,&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;infrastructure,&nbsp;ML-specific&nbsp;tooling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;workflow&nbsp;orchestration.&nbsp;Learners&nbsp;are&nbsp;typically&nbsp;job-ready&nbsp;within&nbsp;4&nbsp;to&nbsp;8&nbsp;months,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;prior&nbsp;DevOps&nbsp;or&nbsp;ML&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;Python&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;primary&nbsp;language&nbsp;used;&nbsp;a&nbsp;computer&nbsp;science&nbsp;degree&nbsp;is&nbsp;not&nbsp;mandatory.</p><h2><strong>Why&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOPS&nbsp;Course&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026?</strong></h2><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The&nbsp;global&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;from&nbsp;$2.43B&nbsp;in&nbsp;2025&nbsp;to&nbsp;$56.60B&nbsp;by&nbsp;2035&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;37%&nbsp;CAGR.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;BFSI&nbsp;holds&nbsp;the&nbsp;largest&nbsp;end-user&nbsp;market&nbsp;share&nbsp;at&nbsp;roughly&nbsp;28%;&nbsp;healthcare&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;fastest-growing&nbsp;vertical.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Employment&nbsp;for&nbsp;software&nbsp;developers,&nbsp;QA&nbsp;analysts,&nbsp;and&nbsp;testers&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;15%&nbsp;through&nbsp;2034.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The&nbsp;average&nbsp;US&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;salary&nbsp;of&nbsp;$161,411&nbsp;exceeds&nbsp;the&nbsp;broader&nbsp;software&nbsp;developer&nbsp;median&nbsp;of&nbsp;roughly&nbsp;$130,000.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cloud&nbsp;deployments&nbsp;account&nbsp;for&nbsp;roughly&nbsp;55%&nbsp;of&nbsp;new&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;platform&nbsp;rollouts.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Many&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;roles&nbsp;are&nbsp;remote-friendly&nbsp;since&nbsp;the&nbsp;work&nbsp;centers&nbsp;on&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;infrastructure.</p><h2><strong>Skills&nbsp;You&nbsp;Learn&nbsp;in&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOPS&nbsp;Course</strong></h2><p>Core&nbsp;skills&nbsp;include&nbsp;designing&nbsp;reproducible&nbsp;ML&nbsp;pipelines&nbsp;from&nbsp;data&nbsp;ingestion&nbsp;to&nbsp;model&nbsp;serving;&nbsp;Docker&nbsp;for&nbsp;containerizing&nbsp;models&nbsp;with&nbsp;exact&nbsp;dependencies;&nbsp;Kubernetes&nbsp;for&nbsp;orchestration,&nbsp;auto-scaling,&nbsp;and&nbsp;failure&nbsp;recovery;&nbsp;MLflow&nbsp;for&nbsp;experiment&nbsp;tracking,&nbsp;versioning,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;model&nbsp;registry;&nbsp;Kubeflow&nbsp;for&nbsp;orchestrating&nbsp;multi-step&nbsp;pipelines&nbsp;on&nbsp;Kubernetes;&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;for&nbsp;automatically&nbsp;testing&nbsp;and&nbsp;shipping&nbsp;model&nbsp;versions;&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;patterns&nbsp;including&nbsp;batch&nbsp;inference,&nbsp;real-time&nbsp;endpoints,&nbsp;canary&nbsp;releases,&nbsp;and&nbsp;blue-green&nbsp;rollout;&nbsp;model&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;for&nbsp;prediction&nbsp;quality,&nbsp;data&nbsp;drift,&nbsp;and&nbsp;concept&nbsp;drift;&nbsp;and&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;work&nbsp;with&nbsp;AWS&nbsp;SageMaker,&nbsp;Google&nbsp;Vertex&nbsp;AI,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Azure&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;since&nbsp;most&nbsp;production&nbsp;ML&nbsp;pipelines&nbsp;run&nbsp;on&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;infrastructure.</p><p>MLOps&nbsp;sits&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;intersection&nbsp;of&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;DevOps,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Cloud&nbsp;Computing.&nbsp;It&nbsp;borrows&nbsp;automation&nbsp;and&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;practices&nbsp;from&nbsp;DevOps,&nbsp;data&nbsp;pipeline&nbsp;discipline&nbsp;from&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;and&nbsp;scalable&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;from&nbsp;Cloud&nbsp;Computing,&nbsp;applying&nbsp;all&nbsp;three&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;ML&nbsp;model&nbsp;lifecycle.</p><p>Learners&nbsp;comparing&nbsp;this&nbsp;path&nbsp;often&nbsp;also&nbsp;explore&nbsp;a&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/machine-learning-course" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">machine&nbsp;learning&nbsp;course</a></strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;strengthen&nbsp;model-building&nbsp;fundamentals,&nbsp;or&nbsp;review&nbsp;the<strong><a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-engineer-course" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;Course</a></strong>&nbsp;and<a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-science-course-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;</a><strong><a href="https://www.nidads.com/blog/data-science-course-2026" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Course</a></strong>&nbsp;for&nbsp;adjacent&nbsp;specializations&nbsp;before&nbsp;choosing&nbsp;a&nbsp;final&nbsp;track.</p><h2><strong>MLOPS&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;vs&nbsp;DEVOPS&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;vs&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Engineer</strong></h2><table><tbody><tr><td data-row="1"><strong>Factor</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>MLOPS&nbsp;Engineer</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>DEVOPS&nbsp;Engineer</strong></td><td data-row="1"><strong>ML&nbsp;Engineer</strong></td></tr><tr><td data-row="2">Primary&nbsp;Focus</td><td data-row="2">Deploying&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;ML&nbsp;models</td><td data-row="2">Software&nbsp;delivery&nbsp;automation</td><td data-row="2">Building&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;training&nbsp;models</td></tr><tr><td data-row="3">Core&nbsp;Tools</td><td data-row="3">Docker,&nbsp;Kubernetes,&nbsp;MLflow</td><td data-row="3">Jenkins,&nbsp;Terraform,&nbsp;Ansible</td><td data-row="3">Python,&nbsp;PyTorch,&nbsp;Pandas</td></tr><tr><td data-row="4">Coding&nbsp;Required</td><td data-row="4">Moderate-High</td><td data-row="4">Moderate</td><td data-row="4">High</td></tr><tr><td data-row="5">India&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;(Entry)</td><td data-row="5">₹6-10&nbsp;LPA</td><td data-row="5">₹5-9&nbsp;LPA</td><td data-row="5">₹8-18&nbsp;LPA</td></tr><tr><td data-row="6">India&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;(Mid)</td><td data-row="6">₹12-20&nbsp;LPA</td><td data-row="6">₹10-16&nbsp;LPA</td><td data-row="6">₹18-40&nbsp;LPA</td></tr><tr><td data-row="7">US&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;(Avg)</td><td data-row="7">$130,000-$165,000</td><td data-row="7">$110,000-$150,000</td><td data-row="7">$140,000-$180,000</td></tr><tr><td data-row="8">Best&nbsp;Entry&nbsp;Cert</td><td data-row="8">AWS&nbsp;ML&nbsp;Specialty,&nbsp;CKA</td><td data-row="8">AWS/Azure&nbsp;DevOps&nbsp;Associate</td><td data-row="8">Google&nbsp;Professional&nbsp;ML&nbsp;Engineer</td></tr></tbody></table><h2><strong>MLOPS&nbsp;Course&nbsp;Syllabus</strong></h2><p>A&nbsp;typical&nbsp;syllabus&nbsp;covers:&nbsp;Python&nbsp;and&nbsp;ML&nbsp;fundamentals;&nbsp;Git&nbsp;and&nbsp;version&nbsp;control&nbsp;for&nbsp;code,&nbsp;data,&nbsp;and&nbsp;models&nbsp;using&nbsp;DVC;&nbsp;Docker&nbsp;and&nbsp;containerization;&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;pipelines&nbsp;with&nbsp;Jenkins&nbsp;or&nbsp;GitHub&nbsp;Actions;&nbsp;workflow&nbsp;orchestration&nbsp;with&nbsp;Apache&nbsp;Airflow&nbsp;or&nbsp;Kubeflow;&nbsp;experiment&nbsp;tracking&nbsp;with&nbsp;MLflow;&nbsp;Kubernetes&nbsp;for&nbsp;scalable&nbsp;deployment;&nbsp;cloud-specific&nbsp;ML&nbsp;services;&nbsp;model&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;and&nbsp;observability;&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;capstone&nbsp;project&nbsp;covering&nbsp;the&nbsp;full&nbsp;pipeline&nbsp;from&nbsp;data&nbsp;to&nbsp;a&nbsp;deployed,&nbsp;monitored&nbsp;model.</p><h2><strong>MLOPS&nbsp;Certifications</strong></h2><p>Recognized&nbsp;certifications&nbsp;include&nbsp;AWS&nbsp;Certified&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;-&nbsp;Specialty,&nbsp;Google&nbsp;Professional&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Engineer,&nbsp;Microsoft&nbsp;Certified:&nbsp;Azure&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;Associate,&nbsp;Certified&nbsp;Kubernetes&nbsp;Administrator,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Databricks&nbsp;Certified&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Associate.&nbsp;A&nbsp;certification&nbsp;strengthens&nbsp;a&nbsp;resume&nbsp;when&nbsp;paired&nbsp;with&nbsp;real&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;projects;&nbsp;employers&nbsp;consistently&nbsp;rank&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;capstone&nbsp;work&nbsp;above&nbsp;certification&nbsp;badges&nbsp;alone.</p><h2><strong>Placement&nbsp;Support&nbsp;and&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Evidence</strong></h2><p>Structured&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;programs&nbsp;document&nbsp;placement&nbsp;outcomes,&nbsp;maintain&nbsp;verifiable&nbsp;GitHub&nbsp;portfolios,&nbsp;and&nbsp;require&nbsp;a&nbsp;capstone&nbsp;project&nbsp;covering&nbsp;containerization,&nbsp;CI/CD,&nbsp;and&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;-&nbsp;typically&nbsp;a&nbsp;Dockerized&nbsp;model&nbsp;API,&nbsp;a&nbsp;CI/CD&nbsp;retraining&nbsp;pipeline,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;Kubernetes&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;with&nbsp;drift&nbsp;monitoring.&nbsp;Mock&nbsp;interviews&nbsp;cover&nbsp;system&nbsp;design&nbsp;and&nbsp;pipeline&nbsp;debugging;&nbsp;resumes&nbsp;are&nbsp;optimized&nbsp;with&nbsp;keyword&nbsp;mapping&nbsp;for&nbsp;applicant&nbsp;tracking&nbsp;systems.</p><h2><strong>Career&nbsp;and&nbsp;Salary&nbsp;After&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOPS&nbsp;Course</strong></h2><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;Engineer:&nbsp;₹6-35&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India,&nbsp;$87,000-$240,000&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Senior&nbsp;MLOps/ML&nbsp;Platform&nbsp;Engineer:&nbsp;₹20-40&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India,&nbsp;$170,000-$315,000&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Engineer:&nbsp;₹8-40&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India,&nbsp;$140,000-$180,000&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US.</p><p>•&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;AI&nbsp;Infrastructure&nbsp;Engineer:&nbsp;₹10-30&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India,&nbsp;$130,000-$200,000&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US.</p><p>Figures&nbsp;vary&nbsp;by&nbsp;city&nbsp;and&nbsp;company.</p><h2><strong>Industries&nbsp;Hiring&nbsp;MLOPS&nbsp;Engineers</strong></h2><p>BFSI&nbsp;leads&nbsp;adoption&nbsp;with&nbsp;real-time&nbsp;fraud&nbsp;detection&nbsp;and&nbsp;regulatory&nbsp;compliance&nbsp;needs.&nbsp;Healthcare&nbsp;uses&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;for&nbsp;diagnostic&nbsp;model&nbsp;monitoring;&nbsp;retail&nbsp;and&nbsp;e-commerce&nbsp;for&nbsp;recommendation&nbsp;engines;&nbsp;manufacturing&nbsp;for&nbsp;predictive&nbsp;maintenance.&nbsp;Other&nbsp;active&nbsp;sectors&nbsp;include&nbsp;autonomous&nbsp;vehicles,&nbsp;cybersecurity,&nbsp;telecommunications,&nbsp;logistics,&nbsp;and&nbsp;government.</p><h2><strong>Learning&nbsp;Roadmap</strong></h2><h2><img src="data:image/webp;base64,"><strong>Common&nbsp;Mistakes&nbsp;Beginners&nbsp;Make</strong></h2><p>Learning&nbsp;only&nbsp;model-building&nbsp;while&nbsp;skipping&nbsp;deployment;&nbsp;ignoring&nbsp;version&nbsp;control&nbsp;for&nbsp;data&nbsp;and&nbsp;models,&nbsp;not&nbsp;just&nbsp;code;&nbsp;treating&nbsp;monitoring&nbsp;as&nbsp;optional;&nbsp;choosing&nbsp;a&nbsp;course&nbsp;with&nbsp;no&nbsp;hands-on&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;labs;&nbsp;and&nbsp;not&nbsp;building&nbsp;a&nbsp;public&nbsp;portfolio&nbsp;of&nbsp;deployed&nbsp;models.</p><h2><strong>Future&nbsp;Scope&nbsp;of&nbsp;MLOPS</strong></h2><p>MLOps&nbsp;is&nbsp;expanding&nbsp;into&nbsp;LLMOps,&nbsp;which&nbsp;applies&nbsp;similar&nbsp;principles&nbsp;to&nbsp;large&nbsp;language&nbsp;models&nbsp;and&nbsp;AI&nbsp;agents,&nbsp;adding&nbsp;prompt&nbsp;versioning,&nbsp;agent&nbsp;evaluation,&nbsp;and&nbsp;inference&nbsp;cost&nbsp;management.&nbsp;Related&nbsp;growth&nbsp;areas&nbsp;include&nbsp;AI&nbsp;observability,&nbsp;model&nbsp;governance,&nbsp;and&nbsp;responsible&nbsp;AI&nbsp;practices.</p><p>For&nbsp;official&nbsp;data&nbsp;on&nbsp;employment&nbsp;growth&nbsp;and&nbsp;market&nbsp;size,&nbsp;see&nbsp;the<a href="https://www.bls.gov/ooh/computer-and-information-technology/software-developers.htm" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;U.S.&nbsp;Bureau&nbsp;of&nbsp;Labor&nbsp;Statistics&nbsp;Occupational&nbsp;Outlook&nbsp;for&nbsp;Software&nbsp;Developers</a>&nbsp;and&nbsp;the<a href="https://www.precedenceresearch.com/mlops-market" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">&nbsp;Precedence&nbsp;Research&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;Market&nbsp;report</a>.</p><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p>An&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course&nbsp;builds&nbsp;employment-ready&nbsp;skills&nbsp;in&nbsp;Docker,&nbsp;Kubernetes,&nbsp;MLflow,&nbsp;CI/CD,&nbsp;and&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;deployment.&nbsp;The&nbsp;global&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;reach&nbsp;$56.60&nbsp;billion&nbsp;by&nbsp;2035,&nbsp;and&nbsp;related&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;roles&nbsp;are&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;15%&nbsp;through&nbsp;2034.&nbsp;Entry-level&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;start&nbsp;at&nbsp;₹6-10&nbsp;LPA&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;and&nbsp;$87,000-$130,000&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US,&nbsp;with&nbsp;progression&nbsp;tied&nbsp;to&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;certification&nbsp;and&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;experience.&nbsp;Select&nbsp;a&nbsp;program&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;verified&nbsp;curriculum,&nbsp;real&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;projects,&nbsp;and&nbsp;documented&nbsp;placement&nbsp;outcomes.</p><h2><strong>Frequently&nbsp;Asked&nbsp;Questions</strong></h2><p><strong>Is&nbsp;coding&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course?</strong></p><p>Yes.&nbsp;Python&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;primary&nbsp;language&nbsp;used&nbsp;across&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;tooling,&nbsp;along&nbsp;with&nbsp;YAML&nbsp;for&nbsp;pipeline&nbsp;configuration&nbsp;and&nbsp;Bash&nbsp;for&nbsp;automation&nbsp;scripting.</p><p><strong>What&nbsp;is&nbsp;the&nbsp;duration&nbsp;of&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course?</strong></p><p>Most&nbsp;focused&nbsp;programs&nbsp;take&nbsp;4&nbsp;to&nbsp;8&nbsp;months,&nbsp;depending&nbsp;on&nbsp;prior&nbsp;DevOps&nbsp;or&nbsp;ML&nbsp;experience;&nbsp;learners&nbsp;with&nbsp;existing&nbsp;Docker&nbsp;or&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;exposure&nbsp;often&nbsp;finish&nbsp;faster.</p><p><strong>Which&nbsp;certification&nbsp;is&nbsp;most&nbsp;valued&nbsp;by&nbsp;employers?</strong></p><p>AWS&nbsp;Certified&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;-&nbsp;Specialty&nbsp;and&nbsp;Google&nbsp;Professional&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning&nbsp;Engineer&nbsp;are&nbsp;the&nbsp;most&nbsp;in-demand&nbsp;for&nbsp;cloud-based&nbsp;roles;&nbsp;Certified&nbsp;Kubernetes&nbsp;Administrator&nbsp;is&nbsp;valued&nbsp;for&nbsp;orchestration-heavy&nbsp;positions&nbsp;and&nbsp;platform&nbsp;teams.</p><p><strong>What&nbsp;salary&nbsp;does&nbsp;a&nbsp;fresher&nbsp;earn&nbsp;after&nbsp;an&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;course?</strong></p><p>Entry-level&nbsp;salaries&nbsp;in&nbsp;India&nbsp;typically&nbsp;range&nbsp;from&nbsp;₹6-10&nbsp;LPA;&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;US,&nbsp;entry-level&nbsp;roles&nbsp;start&nbsp;around&nbsp;$87,000-$130,000,&nbsp;rising&nbsp;with&nbsp;cloud&nbsp;certification&nbsp;and&nbsp;deployment&nbsp;experience.</p><p><strong>Is&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;a&nbsp;good&nbsp;career&nbsp;in&nbsp;2026?</strong></p><p>Yes.&nbsp;The&nbsp;global&nbsp;market&nbsp;is&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;37%&nbsp;CAGR&nbsp;through&nbsp;2035,&nbsp;and&nbsp;related&nbsp;software&nbsp;and&nbsp;infrastructure&nbsp;roles&nbsp;are&nbsp;projected&nbsp;to&nbsp;grow&nbsp;15%&nbsp;through&nbsp;2034,&nbsp;well&nbsp;above&nbsp;the&nbsp;3%&nbsp;average&nbsp;for&nbsp;all&nbsp;occupations.</p><p><strong>Which&nbsp;programming&nbsp;language&nbsp;is&nbsp;used&nbsp;most&nbsp;in&nbsp;MLOps?</strong></p><p>Python&nbsp;dominates&nbsp;MLOps&nbsp;tooling,&nbsp;supported&nbsp;by&nbsp;YAML&nbsp;for&nbsp;configuration&nbsp;and&nbsp;Bash&nbsp;for&nbsp;scripting;&nbsp;most&nbsp;orchestration&nbsp;and&nbsp;tracking&nbsp;tools&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;MLflow&nbsp;and&nbsp;Airflow&nbsp;expose&nbsp;Python-first&nbsp;APIs.</p><h2><strong>About&nbsp;the&nbsp;Author</strong></h2><p>Quick&nbsp;facts</p><p><strong>Name:</strong>&nbsp;Shagun</p><p><strong>From:</strong>&nbsp;Delhi</p><p><strong>Education:</strong>&nbsp;B.Tech</p><p><strong>Program:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;and&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics</p><p><strong>Placed&nbsp;in:</strong>&nbsp;NIDADS&nbsp;(National&nbsp;Institute&nbsp;of&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science)</p><p><strong>Covers&nbsp;topics:</strong>&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Analytics,&nbsp;Artificial&nbsp;Intelligence,&nbsp;Machine&nbsp;Learning,&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Engineering,&nbsp;Deep&nbsp;Learning</p><p><strong>Currently&nbsp;working&nbsp;as:&nbsp;</strong>Senior&nbsp;Data&nbsp;Science&nbsp;Trainer</p><p><strong>In&nbsp;her&nbsp;words</strong>:&nbsp;&quot;The&nbsp;best&nbsp;way&nbsp;to&nbsp;learn&nbsp;data&nbsp;science&nbsp;isn&#39;t&nbsp;just&nbsp;solving&nbsp;problems&nbsp;—&nbsp;it&#39;s&nbsp;understanding&nbsp;why&nbsp;the&nbsp;solution&nbsp;works.&nbsp;That&#39;s&nbsp;what&nbsp;I&nbsp;try&nbsp;to&nbsp;teach&nbsp;every&nbsp;single&nbsp;day.&quot;</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  
</body>
</html>